置き換えは搭載見送り／「Windows Terminal Preview 1.10」プレビューではUIを改善","title_link":"https://forest.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1339729.html","text":"　米Microsoftは7月14日（現地時間）、「Windows Terminal 1.9」を正式リリースした。このアップデートの目玉は、いつでもデスクトップ上部に「Windows Terminal」画面を呼び出せる「Quake」モードだ。","image_url":"https://forest.watch.impress.co.jp/img/wf/list/1339/729/image1.png","blocks":null,"ts":1626850949,"service_name":"窓の杜","service_icon":"https://forest.watch.impress.co.jp/favicon.ico","from_url":"https://forest.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1339729.html","original_url":"https://forest.watch.impress.co.jp/docs/news/1339729.html"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"hOpO"}]}]
